From nothing to a working [[ project_name ]] in a few minutes. Everything else is in [% if has_cli %][In-Depth Configuration](In-Depth-Configuration)[% elif kind == 'other' %][Contributing](Contributing)[% else %][API Reference](API-Reference)[% endif %][% if contrib %] and [Deployment](Deployment)[% endif %].

