## Install

[% if kind == 'service' and container_image %]
```sh
docker pull [[ image ]]:latest
```

[% endif %]
[% if has_cli %]
```sh
[[ layer.install_cli ]]
```
[% elif kind == 'other' %]
```sh
git clone [[ repo_url ]] && cd [[ project_name ]]
```
[% else %]
```sh
[[ layer.install_lib ]]
```
[% endif %]

## First run

[% if kind == 'service' and container_image %]
```sh
docker run -d --name [[ project_name ]] -p 127.0.0.1:[[ port ]]:[[ port ]] [[ image ]]:latest
curl http://127.0.0.1:[[ port ]][[ health_path ]]      # {"status":"ok"}
docker exec [[ project_name ]] [[ project_name ]] config   # the effective configuration
```
[% elif has_cli %]
```sh
[[ project_name ]] --help
[[ project_name ]] config      # the effective configuration, and where each value came from
```
[% elif kind == 'other' %]
